    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong>\u00a0Run around an apple orchard as Val, she is the pumpkin headed mascot of a rival pumpkin patch to the apple orchard that she finds herself at. Don't make too much noise or you'll be caught!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk (WASD or Arrow Keys) or Run (Pressing Shift and the WASD or Arrow Keys) to explore the Apple Orchard you find yourself in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with objects when they highlight &quot;E&quot; by pressing &quot;E.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find your way out in less time than 2 minutes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the map for keys and bring them to the exit sign to unlock and leave safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BE CAREFUL if you make too much noise (running into things, walking onto broken things, or jump on loud things) you'll get caught! [In story mode. If you play in Spoopy mode you can't get caught]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore! Sneak! RUN!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong>\u00a0Run around an apple orchard as Val, she is the pumpkin headed mascot of a rival pumpkin patch to the apple orchard that she finds herself at. Don't make too much noise or you'll be caught!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk (WASD or Arrow Keys) or Run (Pressing Shift and the WASD or Arrow Keys) to explore the Apple Orchard you find yourself in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with objects when they highlight &quot;E&quot; by pressing &quot;E.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find your way out in less time than 2 minutes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the map for keys and bring them to the exit sign to unlock and leave safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BE CAREFUL if you make too much noise (running into things, walking onto broken things, or jump on loud things) you'll get caught! [In story mode. If you play in Spoopy mode you can't get caught]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore! Sneak! RUN!</p>",
